# CEVLM/2: synthetic process-linked garden; no biological kinetics or real feeding.
CEVLM/2
name process-garden
model 1
assets
asset crest-glow sprite docs/assets/vlm/crest-glow.svg
asset blood-motion sprite docs/assets/vlm/blood-motion.svg
asset support-flow heatmap docs/assets/vlm/support-flow.svg
asset rna-flow heatmap docs/assets/vlm/rna-flow.svg
asset molecule-signal icon docs/assets/vlm/molecule-signal.svg
endassets
processes
process crest-birth spawn 4 850 1 0 crest-glow
process blood-join spawn 3 600 1 0 blood-motion
process support-bread deposit 4 720 1 0 support-flow
process rna-stream deposit 5 440 0 1 rna-flow
process protein-word molecule 2 360 0 0 molecule-signal
endprocesses
image
spawn 1 neural_progenitor 10 12 0
differentiate 1 central_neuron
molecule 100 support 85 1
endimage
journal
start 101 crest-birth spawn 10 crest_progenitor 10 12 0
start 102 blood-join spawn 11 blood_carrier 3 5 0
start 103 support-bread deposit support 2 2 400
start 104 rna-stream deposit rna 3 1 150
start 105 protein-word molecule 101 protein_proxy 80 1
advance 2
endjournal
